CE_IDENTITY`, model homes, project homes, and even a Don working area can all legitimately coexist under the profile. What cannot coexist safely is **two independent routing realities** where both think they own inbox, active state, handoffs, identity/bootstrap, or command authority.\n\nSo we are not asking Luce, “Which folder looks nicer?” We're asking:\n\n> **Where is the actual operating hierarchy, and does Desktop\\GCE_DON participate in that hierarchy or compete with it?**\n\nThat should give us exactly the evidence we need before we touch Priority 2. memcite"]}, "create_time": 1789412863.192166, "end_turn": true, "id": "2e159792-e5e8-4cb4-95f7-ab3c85b7ddd6", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "content_references": [{"alt": null, "end_idx": 7056, "invalid": false, "matched_text": "memcite", "prefix": null, "prompt_text": null, "refs": [], "safe_urls": [], "start_idx": 7047, "type": "hidden"}], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finish_details": {"stop_tokens": [200002], "type": "stop"}, "is_complete": true, "message_type": "next", "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "model_switcher_deny": [], "parent_id": "59f99a6d-0aec-4162-9245-de15bb858a9b", "request_id": "40c1454d-7092-43ea-a6c5-3530f1791d73", "resolved_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "search_result_groups": [], "story_events": [], "thinking_effort": "standard", "turn_exchange_id": "2393acc4-01b0-41cf-87fa-95f2bfa58284", "turn_id": "ff4ebe8e-4c75-4764-b6f5-3ec1df0d7913", "working_turn_id": "2393acc4-01b0-41cf-87fa-95f2bfa58284"}, "recipient": "all", "status": "finished_successfully", "update_time": 1789412900.652056, "weight": 1}, {"author": {"metadata": {}, "name": null, "role": "system"}, "channel": null, "content": {"content_type": "text", "parts": [""]}, "create_time": 1789412875.4112031, "end_turn": null, "id": "c481de70-c4c4-4dea-8ab4-253f09eb9431", "metadata": {"can_save": false, "chime_version": 1, "clas