should mostly be **LOW/NONE restore value**, not permanent filesystem residents.\n\nThat gives you what you actually want: **one clean machine, with a compact historical ledger instead of a museum of dead environments.**"]}, "create_time": 1789529146.66576, "end_turn": true, "id": "506a6992-3d54-4c90-b33b-ee3ebf8dae8e", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "content_references": [], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finish_details": {"stop_tokens": [200002], "type": "stop"}, "is_complete": true, "message_type": "next", "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "model_switcher_deny": [], "parent_id": "2481a15b-c9f3-4471-b26b-9c6a71c880e1", "request_id": "583e9d4b-4e94-4089-b077-5f8179941699", "resolved_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "search_result_groups": [], "story_events": [], "thinking_effort": "standard", "turn_exchange_id": "f4957e37-fafa-4e71-855f-d3ece7bdeced", "turn_id": "0c73f411-f6a4-4f65-81c8-94331e4eb14e", "working_turn_id": "f4957e37-fafa-4e71-855f-d3ece7bdeced"}, "recipient": "all", "status": "finished_successfully", "update_time": 1789529155.247187, "weight": 1}, {"author": {"metadata": {}, "name": null, "role": "assistant"}, "channel": null, "content": {"content": "Worked for a second", "content_type": "reasoning_recap"}, "create_time": 1789529147.6929, "end_turn": false, "id": "2481a15b-c9f3-4471-b26b-9c6a71c880e1", "metadata": {"can_save": false, "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finished_duration_sec": 0, "hide_inline_actions": true, "message_type": "next", "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "model_switcher_deny": [], "parent_id": "df18ff7d-a3e7-426e-8450-023873186d86", "reasoning_end_time": 1789529147.6055293, "reasoning_recap_type": "hide_all", "reasoning_start_time": 1789529146.7408934, "reasoning_status": "reasoning_ended", "request_id": "583e9d4b-4e94-4089-b077-5f8179941699", "r