sktop launcher created;\n   - command surface and named-window navigation were extended.\n\n4. **Falcon / EdgeCrew data scope**\n   - a real Falcon run demonstrated that Falcon could widen into historical WNBA/config material;\n   - Luce verified the missing search-boundary rule;\n   - Falcon T0 was amended to bind `EdgeCrew` to current MLB/Quant roots and fail closed instead of widening.\n\n## Final scope\n\nBy the end, this was no longer a cleanup-engineering session.\n\nThe final state was:\n\n**machine substantially clean → root identity routing operational → current GCE authority coherent → VoiceBridge operational → Falcon bounded to current EdgeCrew → ready to start a new chat for the final loose-file sweep and canonical folder-structure reconciliation.**\n\n---\n\n# 3. ACCOMPLISHMENTS BY DATE\n\n## DATE: 2026-09-16\n\n### WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:\nOpenCode profile-root bootstrap failure was investigated.\n\nThe recon established:\n\n- active model path was `OpenCode → Big Pickle`;\n- Kimi subscription/provider was not involved;\n- profile-root `AGENTS.md` loaded successfully;\n- Luce bootstrap files were intact;\n- the profile root simply lacked any seat/bootstrap routing grammar.\n\n### DECISION / RESULT:\nRoot cause was **CWD-scoped instruction discovery**, not cleanup damage and not provider/model selection.\n\n### WHO / WHICH SEAT OWNED IT:\nDon / Coda / Big Pickle recon\n\n### STATUS:\nverified\n\n---\n\n## DATE: 2026-09-16\n\n### WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:\nA neutral profile-root seat router was implemented.\n\nCreated:\n\n`C:\\Users\\Dekan AI Brother\\GCE_SEAT_ROUTER.md`\n\nand:\n\n`C:\\Users\\Dekan AI Brother\\opencode.json`\n\nThe root config injects the neutral router, which resolves recognized seats to their canonical `GCE_IDENTITY\\<Seat>\\AGENTS.md`.\n\nRecognized seats included:\n\nTalon, Luce, Keel, Coda, Corrado, Calibro, Kimi, Falcon, Raven, Ragno, Chiave.\n\nGLM, Kimi_Plumb, Magpie, and Pigeon remained bounded holds/provisionals.\n\n### DECISION /